    T = "[*] Збереження Кам'яного піку",
    D = "Ласкаво просимо на Пік Кам’яного Кігтя, місце гармонії з природою, Хранитель Альбагорм добре впорався з підтриманням регіону, незважаючи на невдачі. I have been working tirelessly for sometime in maintaining the wildlife around here, and I have been having some issues.$B$BThe Twilight Ru$b$bers of the Peak have been growing more hostile with time, and I fear they may out hunt some of the other wildlife present here. I require from them a single Pristine Twilight Fang, which will be used to conduct research to find any sort of genetic problem, disease, or corruption that may be gripping the population.$B$BYou can find them about Stonetalon Peak, be quick.",
